    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "I Love Boosters"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The writer-director behind Sorry to Bother You (LFF 2018) is back with another idiosyncratic, anti-capitalist vision, featuring an all-star cast that includes Keke Palmer, Naomi Ackie, LaKeith Stanfield and Demi Moore."
    },
